TDOFDFT Al regression without a current-dependent potential.
Use dt=0.001 fs and 51 outputs (50 advances, final time 0.05 fs).
This short trajectory checks propagation and final energy, force and stress
with the existing Autotest tolerances. The timestep was separately assessed
over 0.5 fs; see issue #8272 and PR #8273 for the refinement evidence.
